# This file exists to ensure the local_deps/ directory is tracked by git.
# 
# In local builds (via scripts/build.sh), this directory is populated with
# locally checked-out package source trees when service spec files reference
# local paths (e.g. /home/user/repos/some-repo/some-package).
#
# In GitHub Actions builds, this directory remains empty and packages are
# fetched directly from GitHub via git+https:// URLs in requirements.txt.
#
# The Dockerfiles unconditionally COPY this directory into the image, so it
# must always exist — hence this placeholder file.
